<includeonly>{{Collapsible}}</includeonly>
like [[Template:EnemyList|enemylist]] but with more functionality<br>
invoked with [[User:CursedXyster/EnemyList]]

 <nowiki>{{User:CursedXyster/EnemyList|Doge|Snache|Ensanglion the Calamity}}</nowiki>
{{User:CursedXyster/EnemyList|Doge|Snache|Ensanglion the Calamity}}

 <nowiki>{{User:CursedXyster/EnemyList|px=20|Doge|Snache|Ensanglion the Calamity}}</nowiki>
{{User:CursedXyster/EnemyList|px=20|Doge|Snache|Ensanglion the Calamity}}


you can add custom images too, so long as you add the file extension at the end
 <nowiki>{{User:CursedXyster/EnemyList|px=50|Monaco.png|Seabreeze Coppermine Promotional.png}}</nowiki>
{{User:CursedXyster/EnemyList|px=50|Monaco.png|Seabreeze Coppermine Promotional.png}}

and you can blend together custom images and enemy icons easily as well
 <nowiki>{{User:CursedXyster/EnemyList|Kamisama.c3fdc4d.png|Esoteric Uril|Crazed Tank Cat|Zapy|Hackey|SC35_T2.png}}</nowiki>
{{User:CursedXyster/EnemyList|Kamisama.c3fdc4d.png|Esoteric Uril|Crazed Tank Cat|Zapy|Hackey|SC35_T2.png}}


also you can set appear or appearing to anything that isn't blank and it'll switch it to be like [[Template:EnemiesAppearing|enemiesappearing]]
 <nowiki>{{User:CursedXyster/EnemyList|appear=jfpiaj|Doge|Masked Grandmaster Cat|Grand Mage Mimon}}</nowiki>
{{User:CursedXyster/EnemyList|appear=jfpiaj|Doge|Masked Grandmaster Cat|Grand Mage Mimon}}

 <nowiki>{{User:CursedXyster/EnemyList|appearing=jfpiaj|Doge|Masked Grandmaster Cat|Grand Mage Mimon}}</nowiki>
{{User:CursedXyster/EnemyList|appearing=jfpiaj|Doge|Masked Grandmaster Cat|Grand Mage Mimon}}

you can even add links before the custom images
 <nowiki>{{User:CursedXyster/EnemyList|Dark Dober|link:Dynasaurus Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Uni763 c00.png|Cursed luna.png|link:Squire Luno (Uber Rare Cat)|838 1.png|link:Lone Moon Lunos (Uber Rare Cat)|860 1.png}}</nowiki>
{{User:CursedXyster/EnemyList|Dark Dober|link:Dynasaurus Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Uni763 c00.png|Cursed luna.png|link:Squire Luno (Uber Rare Cat)|838 1.png|link:Lone Moon Lunos (Uber Rare Cat)|860 1.png}}
 <nowiki>{{User:CursedXyster/EnemyList|appearing=a|Dark Dober|link:Dynasaurus Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Uni763 c00.png|Cursed luna.png|link:Squire Luno (Uber Rare Cat)|838 1.png|link:Lone Moon Lunos (Uber Rare Cat)|860 1.png}}</nowiki>
{{User:CursedXyster/EnemyList|appearing=a|Dark Dober|link:Dynasaurus Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Uni763 c00.png|Cursed luna.png|link:Squire Luno (Uber Rare Cat)|838 1.png|link:Lone Moon Lunos (Uber Rare Cat)|860 1.png}}

you can also use the format E-ID instead of the enemy's name
 <nowiki>{{User:CursedXyster/EnemyList|E-012|E-12|E-123|E-506|E-715}}</nowiki>
{{User:CursedXyster/EnemyList|E-012|E-12|E-123|E-506|E-715}}